ut only 25 cars made it  the rest were turned back a russian  soldier was shooting in the air he  warned us that next time he will shoot  to kill  russia wants to make sure soldiers hold  up at the factory don't sneak out among  the civilians  for those who make it  these are difficult but joyful moments  but to those still trapped in mariupol  these are dark hours where the end is  difficult to predict  al jazeera zapurija
 

